or trash bin on the morning of collection day.\n* *Note: Always check your city’s municipal waste guidelines first, as some areas prohibit this.*\n\n### While You Decide\nIf you need some time to arrange a burial or vet visit:\n* Place your hamster in a sealable container or wrap it gently in paper towels and place it in a plastic bag.\n* Keep it in a cool, dry place. If it will be more than a few hours, placing the container in an insulated cooler with ice packs (or a dedicated freezer space) will temporarily preserve the body safely.",
