uals from causing harm:\n* **Mental Health Support:** Psychotherapy (such as Cognitive Behavioral Therapy), support programs, and, in some cases, medication (such as anti-androgens or SSRIs to reduce sex drive) are used to help individuals manage their impulses and prevent harmful behavior.\n* **Confidential Help Lines:** In many countries, confidential, non-judgmental prevention helplines (such as \"Stop It Now!\" in the UK and US, or \"Kein Täter werden\" in Germany) exist to provide support for individuals seeking to manage these attractions without committing offenses.",
